   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "A. Soroka",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The current test for URL-encoding is:</p>\n\n<p>dissURL.indexOf(\"=(\") != -1</p>\n\n<p>Changing this to:</p>\n\n<p>dissURL.indexOf(\"(\" + bindingKeyPattern + \")\") &gt; 0</p>\n\n<p>will create the following changes in behavior:</p>\n\n<p>Input pattern 1:<br/>\ndissURL?queryparameter=(bindingKey)</p>\n\n<p>Old output pattern:<br/>\ndissURL?queryparameter=URL-encoded-datastream-URL</p>\n\n<p>New output pattern:<br/>\nSame.</p>\n\n<p>Input pattern 2:<br/>\ndissURL/(bindingKey)</p>\n\n<p>Old output pattern:<br/>\ndissURL/NON-URL-encoded-datastream-URL</p>\n\n<p>New output pattern:<br/>\ndissURL/URL-encoded-datastream-URL</p>\n\n<p>Input pattern 3:<br/>\n(bindingKey)</p>\n\n<p>Old output pattern:<br/>\nURL-encoded-datastream-URL</p>\n\n<p>New output pattern:<br/>\nNON-URL-encoded-datastream-URL</p>\n\n<p>The immediate advantage is that using datastream URLs as part of the ultimate dissemination URL becomes practical. This allows for the storage of service addresses as external datastreams, and the <em>form</em> of action against them to be encoded in dissemination metadata.</p>",
     "created": "14/May/12 4:07 AM",
     "id": "12289",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11046/comment/12289",
