  "description": "<p>The current behavior of dissemination machinery is to URL-encode datastream addresses if the entire dissemination URL contains \"=(\". This is a pretty simple-minded test and makes the use of 'E' datastreams less flexible than otherwise might be the case. The test can be made more subtle.</p>",
